  "engine.guide.denied": "If you blocked notifications: lock icon in the address bar → Site settings → Notifications → Allow",
  "engine.guide.1.title": "Room chat",
  "engine.guide.1.lead": "Only people in the same room see it",
  "engine.guide.1.i1": "When you write, a speech bubble appears over your head. People in other rooms only see <b>\"...\"</b>",
  "engine.guide.1.i2": "The <b>\"(3 people)\"</b> next to the box is how many people it reaches",
  "engine.guide.1.i3": "<b>Cleared when the date changes</b>",
  "engine.guide.2.title": "Calls",
  "engine.guide.2.lead": "Each room has its own call",
  "engine.guide.2.i1": "Click it to open this room's call in a new tab. <b>Everyone in the room who clicks joins the same call</b>",
  "engine.guide.2.i2": "Once opened, the square on your name tag turns <i class=\"sq meet\"></i><b>blue (in a meeting)</b>",
  "engine.guide.2.i3": "To talk with someone in another room, click them and choose <b>\"Got a minute?\"</b>. The request appears on their screen",
  "engine.guide.3.title": "Status",
  "engine.guide.3.lead": "Your name tag color shows your status to everyone",
  "engine.guide.3.i1": "<i class=\"sq focus\"></i><b>Focus</b>: you put on headphones (25 minutes)",
  "engine.guide.3.i2": "<i class=\"sq break\"></i><b>Break</b>: you hold a cup",
  "engine.guide.3.i3": "<i class=\"sq meet\"></i><b>In a meeting</b>: automatic while you are in a meeting room",
  "engine.guide.3.i4": "<b>\"Away\"</b> makes you <b>semi-transparent</b>. Click again to come back",
  "engine.guide.3.i5": "Click <b>\"Emotes\"</b> and pick one: your character does it for a few seconds on <b>everyone's screen</b>",
  "engine.guide.4.title": "Leaving",
  "engine.guide.4.lead": "Use \"Leave\" when you go home",
  "engine.guide.4.i1": "On everyone else's screen, you <b>say goodbye and walk out</b>",
  "engine.guide.4.i2": "If you forget, <b>you leave the office automatically after {h}:00 when there is no activity</b>",
  "engine.guide.4.i3": "The next day, click <b>\"Enter\"</b> again and take a seat",
